# Python style (ai/)

Global: [preserve-layout](../../../.cursor/rules/preserve-layout.mdc) — **read the block you are editing first.**

## Default for new code

One statement per beat when the surrounding file does the same. Long lines are fine.

## Also

- `# DEVIATION:` when diverging from stock Gymnasium / SB3 / PyTorch patterns (see [collaborator-context](../../../.cursor/rules/collaborator-context.mdc)).
- Type hints and `from __future__ import annotations` match existing modules in `blitzbowl_ai/`.
